<div data-toggle-group="mainmenu" data-toggle-id="menu-show" data-toggle-class="rug-hidden-m--block" class="rug-layout__item rug-width-m-16-24">
<div>
<div class="rug-panel--content rug-panel--content--border">
<h1 class="rug-mb-0 rug-clearfix">Online Bachelor's Week</h1>
<div class="rug-h3 rug-font-neutral rug-mt-xxs">7-11 December 2026</div>
</div>
<div id="target-content-holder"></div>
<div>
<div class="rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>
<p>During the Online Bachelor's Week all our Bachelor's degree programmes will be represented online.</p>
<p>
<em>More information will be posted on this page in due course.</em>
</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-clearfix"></div>
<div class="rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>
<h3>
<strong>Reminder Service</strong>
</h3>
<p>Would you like to receive an email the moment you can register for the Online Bachelor's Week? Please leave your details via the button below.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-clearfix"></div>
<div class="rug-mb-xm">
<a href="https://go.rug.nl/form/reminderserviceonlinebachelorweekdec2026" class="rug-button rug-button--secondary rug-button--medium rug-mr-s rug-button__grid-two" target="_blank">Reminder Service Online Bachelor's Week<span class="rug-icon rug-icon--caret-right rug-ml" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
</div>
<div class="rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>
<h3>Chat to a student</h3>
<p>Want to talk to someone about what it's like to be a student here? Find out more from one of our current students through our <a href="/education/chat-with-our-students">online chat system</a>.</p>
<h3>Online University Tour</h3>
<p>Want to get a feel of what studying in Groningen is like? Visit our main buildings with this <a href="/education/bachelor/online-university-tour">interactive online university tour</a>.&nbsp;</p>
<h3>Student life</h3>
<p>Learn about <a href="https://www.groningenlife.nl/" target="_blank">student life</a> at the University of Groningen, and find out more about all the exciting opportunities you'll have while studying here.</p>
<h3>Special needs?</h3>
<p>Do you experience barriers due to a functional impairment (disability) or illness? Do you perhaps have a caretaker&rsquo;s role or, sooner or later, you want to combine your studies with top-class sport, entrepreneurship or parenthood? Take a look at our &nbsp;<a href="/education/student-service-centre/bijzondere-omstandigheden/studying-with-special-needs/">website about studying with special needs</a>.</p>
<h3>Blog posts</h3>
<p>Read our <a href="/education/student-blog/?lang=en">blog</a> to discover what life as a UG student is like, and to get some great tips about how to make the most of your time here.</p>
<h3>Questions?</h3>
<p>If you have questions about this event or would like more information in general, please contact us at <span class="js--decode" data-encoded="PGEgaHJlZj0ibWFpbHRvOnN0dWRpZWtpZXplcnNAcnVnLm5sIj5zdHVkaWVraWV6ZXJzQHJ1Zy5ubDwvYT4=">studiekiezers rug.nl</span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-clearfix"></div>
<div class="rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>
<h2>Upcoming onsite Bachelor's Open Days</h2>
<div class="rug-clearfix"></div>
<div class="rug-table-wrapper">
<div style="display: none;" class="rug-table-navigator">
<div role="button" data-mode="previous" class="rug-table-navigator__button" aria-label="Navigate to the left">
<span class="rug-icon rug-icon--angle-left"></span>
</div>
<div role="button" data-mode="next" class="rug-table-navigator__button" aria-label="Navigate to the right">
<span class="rug-icon rug-icon--angle-right"></span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-table-holder">
